# akashnalawade.com

Independent personal site for Marathi actor Akash Nalawade. Final target: SEO-friendly, mobile-friendly, static on shared Linux hosting (no Node/PHP runtime).

## Architecture

- Vite + React **multi-page app**: `index.html`, `about/index.html`, `work/index.html`
- Shared React via `data-page` on `#root` (`src/main.jsx` → `src/App.jsx`)
- Copy and credits live in `src/data.js` — do not scatter facts across pages
- Production = contents of `dist/` uploaded to `public_html`

## Do

- Keep three real HTML entry points (crawlers see `/`, `/about/`, `/work/`)
- Prefer CSS in `src/index.css`; avoid new CSS libraries unless asked
- Use public, sourced facts only; do not invent credits or quotes
- After finishing work, update `docs/DONE.md` and `docs/TARGETS.md`

## Do not

- Add `BrowserRouter` / HashRouter as the only page model
- Commit secrets, `.env`, or `node_modules`
- Generate fake photos of the actor
